        "method": "Published author proof/core and local context fidelity screening",
        "note": "Complete author Theorem1.1 proof and essential new Propositions5.1 and Lemmas5.10–5.11 are included. Work in the stated noncommutative probability space (A,phi), for every positive n and ordered list a1,...,an; no traciality or commutativity is assumed. ST(n), noncrossing partition pi(t), skeleton sk(t) and the strict-order-surjection definition of the Murua coefficient are all bundled. Existing double-tensor and decorated-tree unshuffle/Hopf structures and their morphism iota are explicitly prior results [5,7,14], not counted as new supports. The new cut-surjection bijection and full convolution coefficient proof are present; regrouped noncrossing, free and Boolean consequences are contextual only."
